  "notes": "Agent re-read after the Code Health refactor, 2026-11-07, under the owner directive transcribed in verification/reviews/rulings/agent-rereview-after-refactor-2026-11-07.md. This record is NOT an owner signature: it attests the agent's substantive reading only. Read http_profile.request_floor_result, http_profile.freshness_window and core.ed25519_primitive (unchanged). In the floor verifier: verify_under takes SignatureOver (base, sig) and passes the same two values to verify_ed25519_with; floor_bound_response and full_bound_response take a BoundExchange (response, request) that is destructured at once and pass-through to the same checks in the same order; sf_dictionary.rs shares one top-level split (QuoteScan) between split_dictionary and split_parameters with the same quote, escape, separator and trim rules, and member_value delegates its per-member refusals (empty member, neighbour label, label without a value) to labelled_value in the same order; signature_parameters.rs splits check_tail_spelling's refusals into has_empty_segment and has_space_outside_quotes behind the same single error. sigbase.rs resolves a covered component through one Origin (request for `;req`, else the message; a `;req` without a request is missing), derived_value and field_value: the same table of derived components, the same exactly-once field lookup with only SP/HTAB trimmed, the same MissingCoveredComponent for every absence, and signature_base still resolves the components before it serializes the parameters. block.rs became block/{actor,audience,continuation,request,response}.rs with the module tree and re-exports kept in block.rs. The 31 tests moved with their types and keep their names (31 before, 31 after). Production code moved as written except two spellings: HttpContinuation::verify's three-way `||` disjunction became three sequential ifs that check the previous-request handle, the response handle and the request-state digest in that order and return the same ContinuationBindingFailed, and rustfmt reflowed one refusal. ArtifactBinding and its vocabulary files are untouched. The request signers take one RequestSignature {key_id, created, expires, nonce} in place of four loose arguments; every test call maps the same values to the same fields. Tests that changed are mechanical (RequestSignature fields) or move an assertion into a helper with the same expectation. The claim, premises and the THM-0001 dependency are unchanged. Evidence class as registered; V0 units are tested and probed, not machine-checked proofs. The mutation lane was not re-run by this reading; check-registries resolves every probe anchor, and every tested symbol the unit names still names a test function.",
